{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Document Service API",
    "description": "Pure document storage and management microservice",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/documents/": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Documents"
        ],
        "summary": "List User Documents",
        "description": "Retrieve a paginated list of documents for the authenticated user.\n\nThis endpoint returns documents owned by the current user with support for:\n- **Filtering** by document type (CV or Job Description)\n- **Pagination** with customizable limit and offset\n- **Ordering** by creation date (newest first)\n\n## Parameters\n\n- **file_type** (optional): Filter documents by type\n    - `cv` - Return only Resume/CV documents\n    - `jd` - Return only Job description documents\n    - *omitted* - Return all document types (default behavior)\n\n- **limit**: Number of documents per page (1-100, default: 50)\n\n- **offset**: Skip this many documents for pagination (default: 0)\n\n## Response\n\nReturns a structured response with:\n- **documents**: Array of document objects with metadata\n- **total_count**: Total number of documents matching the filter\n- **pagination info**: limit, offset, has_more flags\n\n## Examples\n\n- Get all documents: `GET /documents`\n- Get only CV documents: `GET /documents?file_type=cv`\n- Get only job descriptions: `GET /documents?file_type=jd`\n- Get first 10 CV documents: `GET /documents?file_type=cv&limit=10`\n- Get next page of all documents: `GET /documents?limit=10&offset=10`\n\n## Security\n\n- Requires authentication (JWT token)\n- Users can only access their own documents\n- Results are automatically filtered by user ownership",
        "operationId": "get_documents_api_v1_documents__get",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          },
          {
            "OAuth2": [
              "read:documents",
              "write:documents",
              "delete:documents"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "file_type",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^(cv|jd)$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "description": "Filter by document type. Omit to return all document types.",
              "examples": {
                "cv": {
                  "summary": "CV/Resume documents only",
                  "value": "cv"
                },
                "jd": {
                  "summary": "Job description documents only",
                  "value": "jd"
                },
                "all": {
                  "summary": "All document types (default)",
                  "description": "Omit this parameter to get all document types"
                }
              },
              "title": "File Type"
            },
            "description": "Filter by document type. Omit to return all document types."
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "maximum": 100,
              "minimum": 1,
              "description": "Maximum number of documents to return per page",
              "default": 50,
              "title": "Limit"
            },
            "description": "Maximum number of documents to return per page",
            "example": 10
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "description": "Number of documents to skip for pagination",
              "default": 0,
              "title": "Offset"
            },
            "description": "Number of documents to skip for pagination",
            "example": 0
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentListResponseModel"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/documents/{document_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Documents"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Document",
        "description": "Get a specific document by ID\n\n- **document_id**: UUID of the document to retrieve\n\nReturns complete document information including extracted text.",
        "operationId": "get_document_api_v1_documents__document_id__get",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          },
          {
            "OAuth2": [
              "read:documents",
              "write:documents",
              "delete:documents"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "document_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "title": "Document Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResponse"
